Hierbij de gevraagde aanvullende gegevens.

A reply that carries an attachment, which is the case a mail-driven process actually cares
about: the supplementary information the citizen was asked for arrives as a file, not as
prose.

This resumes the case that 03-attachments.eml started, and MailDocumentAttachments runs on
the receive task too, so the attachment below joins the two the original mail already put
on the Documents tab. Watch the tab go from three files to five - the reply's body counts
as one as well.

One thing to notice if several cases are waiting on the same Message-ID: only the first of
them gets these files. See MailDocumentAttachments.metadataOrNull.

